# internal working notes — moved to ~/Desktop/GITHUB_PDF_NOTES in Aug 2026
#
# GitHub Pages serves every file in this repository, so a committed .md sits
# at a public URL whether or not anything links to it. robots.txt would only
# ask crawlers not to fetch these; it would not keep them out of an index.
# They live outside the repository instead.
/docs/
/_*.md
/SEO_*.md
/*_AUDIT*.md
/*_audit*.md
